      "value": "This isn't a bug! \nOne (or more) of the meshes on your avatar has Mesh Read/Write disabled. The new SDK will check for and auto-fix this.\nIn fact, you can see it at the top of the warnings! Click the \"Auto-fix\" button!!\nPlease read the warnings!",
