  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Vrchat Version: 2021.3.2\nSo, I was working on a model and I noticed in the control panel that the poly's went up an alarming amount.\n I exported the model from blender as an fbx file. I tried reducing the poly's on blender, by a large amount, and it still gave me the same answer of  2,147,483,647 Poly's. Tried on a different model entirely and the same number. For some reason, it always gave me the exact same amount of poly's for the model.\n\nIt's hard for me to tell what is causing this but I hope this issue can be solved.",
